WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:02.451
Opposite angles are equal.

2
00:00:02.952 --> 00:00:06.452
In a parallelogram, opposite angles are equal.

3
00:00:06.904 --> 00:00:12.079
Neighbouring angles add to one hundred and eighty. They are co-interior angles.

4
00:00:12.883 --> 00:00:17.008
Move one corner, and opposite angles are no longer equal.
